		(property "Description" "TI TPS63070 buck-boost converter, 2 A switch current, VIN 2 to 16 V, VOUT 2.5 to 9 V, VQFN-15 2.5x3 mm; pin layout mirrors datasheet typical application. Terminals 12/13 (VIN) and 7/8 (VOUT) are each internally common and share a single land; pin 8 is typed passive so ERC accepts it alongside power output pin 7. Pinout is common to TPS63070, TPS630701 and TPS630702"
